# Research · Memory · Fact-check

Before material claims or integrations:

1. Read `memory/CURRENT_STATE.md`, `memory/FACT_CHECK.md`, and the latest `memory/SESSION_LOG.md`.
2. Prefer official docs (Privy, Agora, Envio, Monad, Kuru, Mera).
3. Live-check with Tavily and/or TinyFish (`agent.tinyfish.ai`, `X-API-Key`).
4. Never invent contract addresses, chain IDs, or API shapes.
5. After work: append `SESSION_LOG`, update `CURRENT_STATE`, record verified facts in `FACT_CHECK`.

If docs and Bible conflict, fact-check wins — then update memory.
